for WtO... a way for Spectres to leak to our reality.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T14:13:33-07:00","id":197161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/197138-the-dark-corners-of-the-earth-location-location-location#post197138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The classic WoD has tackled some strange places within its own cannons. but i was thinking on taking places from the pop culture/real locations and places the WoD havent tackled. the idea is to share locations to be used as storyhooks, plot hooks etc....</div> </div> </div> </div>There has been two books on San Fransisco (<i>KotE and Changeling</i>) and two books on Los Angeles (<i>Demon and Vampire</i>), and they really didn't cover much of anything that's between those two big cities, anything above San Fran, or below L.A. (<i>Like San Diego</i>). So yeah, I know of some locations not covered in my area.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://www.weirdca.com/location.php?location=76\" target=\"_blank\">The Billiwhack Monster</a> </b>(<i>Aliso Canyon Road, Santa Paula</i>, <i>CA</i>):<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The Billiwhack Dairy according to the legend is a decrepit ruin of what once was a state of the art, very advanced and modern dairy farm. It apparently contains underground rooms and tunnels, but is also rumored to be missing walls, etc, which could be attributed to the many decades of disuse. The dairy was started up and run by an August Rubel who moved to Ventura County in 1922 and established the dairy in 1924. Rubel was once a native of Zurich, Switzerland. He served in the American Field Service in France from 1917 to 1919. The urban legend connects him to the Office of Strategic Services or the OSS. The OSS was the precursor to the Central Intelligence Agency. If the legend is true, the OSS had Ruben performing experiments beneath the dairy, including trying to make a super soldier. The Billiwhack Monster is apparently a product of this research and experimentation that escaped to haunt the local area.<br /> Much like other secret organizations, the OSS is attached to all sorts of illegal and amoral experiments ranging from brainwashing techniques, use of various drugs on unsuspecting victims, studies of diseases for use in warfare, and other inhumane practices.<br /> The OSS was started by William &quot;Wild Bill&quot; (some state his nickname as &quot;Mad Dog&quot;) Donovan who was made the Coordinator of Information or COI in 1941. This office eventually became the OSS. The OSS was responsible for much of the espionage and sabotage in Europe and Asia. The OSS was disbanded after World War II, but a proposal by Donovan eventually led to the formation of the present day CIA.<br /> As the urban legend goes, Rubel, after performing experiments in Ventura County, was eventually sent over seas and died mysteriously doing secret work for the OSS in 1943. According to a historical account, August Rubel actually died in Tunisia, when he returned to service and the ambulance he was driving hit a German land mine.....<br /> <br /> So if there is really a half goat/half man monster lurking in the depths of Santa Paula, there's a lot of questions regarding what it's doing there and how it got there. Although there's little to no evidence of its existence, some cryptozoologists believe it might be related to or actually a Bigfoot, granted a deformed or disfigured Bigfoot. </div> </div> </div>Potentially for either Werewolf or Mage. Since August Rubel might have been a Progenitor, or the Billiwhack Monster is a very early Mockery Breed that's still on the loose.<br /> <br /> <b><a href=\"http://www.weirdus.com/states/california/ghosts/olivas_adobe_ghost/index.php\" target=\"_blank\">Olivas Adobe</a> </b>(<i>Ventura, CA</i>)<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> A midweek afternoon visit, when the place is relatively deserted, is perhaps the best time to look for the disturbed ghost of Senora Teodoro Olivas.<br /> Senora Olivas had reason to worry: the poor woman pumped out 21 kids before hanging up her spurs. There may be another reason she chooses to keep watch over her home, which was completed in 1851. Her husband, Don Raimondo Olivas was deeded 2,200 acres of land bordering the Ventura shore in appreciation for his service in the Mexican Army under General Santa Barbara. He named it Rancho San Miguel. By shrewd political maneuvering and hard work, Olivas became one of the wealthiest ranchers in Alta California. Fiestas held at the adobe lasted for days. All of this of course made him a target for bandits, who staged a vicious raid on his home in 1855.<br /> The robbers rounded up the family and servants and then searched the grounds for valuables. Here, the story gets fuzzy. One version maintains that a trusted Indian servant was secretly given Don Raimundo\u2019s treasure box, reportedly containing anywhere from $3,000 to $75,000 in gold coins (depending on which story you choose to believe) to bury on the grounds while Raimundo stalled the outlaws. When the servant successfully completed his mission, he returned to the adobe and was shot before the desperados realized that he was the only person who knew where the stash was hidden.<br /> The bandidos fared slightly better if you choose to go with the second version of events: After one of them struck Senora Olivas to the ground and ripped her earrings off, the group managed to carry off the treasure and make for the hills. They soon realized that a sizable posse had been rounded up to track them down, so the box was buried in the mountains somewhere between Ventura and Santa Barbara. No one has yet found the lost gold. According to Senate, at least one of the criminals got away, but not forever: \u201cA fellow named Encarnacion Berryessa was in a bar in LA boasting of his many evil deeds\u2014one of which was the robbery of Olivas Adobe. The good patrons of the bar took him out and hung him.\u201d </div> </div> </div>Olivas Adobe is a Haunt in Wraith: the Oblivion. And people in the Skinlands and wraiths in the Shadowlands are still looking for that lost treasure (<i>Possibly a Fetter or Artifact/Relic</i>), even if it still hasn't been found.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T15:22:33-07:00","id":197229,"title":"","content":"Geez, there are literally thousands of places around the earth that fit, and not all are bad (per se). Not including small, local places (mostly because I'm fairly new to the area), a quick look at &quot;Mysterious Places&quot; on Google is all it takes.<br /> <br /> I'm a huge fan of Sedlec Ossuary (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sedlec_Ossuary\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sedlec_Ossuary</a>) in Eastern Europe - if that place wasn't built by either Cappadocians or, more likely, Tzimisce, I dunno what was. It's probably haunted as all hell too, and there's a fantastic chance it's a Haunt.<br /> <br /> The Yonaguni Monument (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yonaguni_Monument\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yonaguni_Monument</a>) can be tough to get into a campaign, but no doubt weresharks and the Void Engineers have their own ideas of what should be done with the place.<br /> <br /> Kholat Syakl is just plain cool. (<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyatlov_Pass_incident\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyatlov_Pass_incident</a>) I mean yeah, it's all been explained away scientifically.... sorta. But what <i>really</i> caused those disappearances? Spectres? Werewolves? Mages or Technocrats trying to make it look like something else? Spirits of the Mansi people? If you're more into mysterious deaths than the places involved, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_unsolved_deaths\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_unsolved_deaths</a>. (Speaking of which, anything involved in the life of H.H.Holmes could serve as a springboard to horrible adventures.)<br /> <br /> There are tons of cheap, usually cheap, books with mysteries - and they generally detail the place where the mystery occurred (i.e., the Devil's Triangle, the Bermuda Triangle, Black Mountain, whatever). They practically beg to be used as resources in the WoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/426-big-brother","name":"Big Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar426_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T15:57:33-07:00","id":197242,"title":"","content":"Some locations near my home.<br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Castel del Monte&quot;, Mountain Castle<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castel_del_Monte,_Apulia\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Castel_del_Monte_-_Andria.jpg/1280px-Castel_del_Monte_-_Andria.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castel_del_Monte,_Apulia\" target=\"_blank\"> Castel del Monte, Apulia - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castel_del_Monte,_Apulia\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castel_del_Monte,_Apulia </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> Constructed during the 1240s by the Emperor Frederick II in the Apulia region of southeast Italy. It has neither a moat nor a drawbridge and some considered it never to have been intended as a defensive fortress. Around <i>Castel del Monte</i> abound rumors.<br /> It's an astronomical observatory, or a mystical sept of the Templar Knights, an arcane pagan temple or a scholar center (and in those years the two thing weren't all too different)?<br /> As a note, it's map is exactly octagonal. Yup, octagonal, like a crown.<br /> <br /> [If you ask me, it has &quot;Order of Hermes&quot; / &quot;Tremere&quot; / &quot;Ventrue&quot; written on every face]<br /> <br /> <br /> ================================================== ========================================<br /> &quot;Sassi di Matera&quot;, Stones of Matera<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sassi_di_Matera\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Matera_boenisch_nov_2005.jpg/1280px-Matera_boenisch_nov_2005.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sassi_di_Matera\" target=\"_blank\"> Sassi di Matera - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sassi_di_Matera\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sassi_di_Matera </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Sassi are ancient cave dwellings in the Italian city of Matera, Basilicata. The Sassi originate from a prehistoric (troglodyte) settlement, and are suspected to be some of the first human settlements in Italy.<br /> The Sassi are houses dug into the calcarenitic rock itself, which is characteristic of Basilicata and Puglia, and is locally called &quot;tufo&quot; though it should not be confused with the volcanic tuff nor with tufa.<br /> As a sidenote, people still live there, in what you can simply call caverns. Globalization, deal with it.<br /> <br /> [If there are still pure Cappadocian methuselah around, they're surely here]<br /> <br /> <br /> ================================================== ========================================<br /> &quot;Grotte di Castellana&quot;, Castellana Caves<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellana_Caves\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Castellana%27s_caves_wolf.jpg/1280px-Castellana%27s_caves_wolf.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellana_Caves\" target=\"_blank\"> Castellana Caves - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellana_Caves\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castellana_Caves </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Caves of Castellana open in south-eastern Murge, a limestone plateau dating back to the upper Cretaceous and rising 330 metres above sea level. The area of Castellana is characterized by limestone, a sedimentary rock composed largely of calcium carbonate, known as Limestone of Altamura. The cave system is 3348 metres in length and the point of maximum depth reaches 122 metres. The temperature within the caves is about 18\u00b0C.<br /> The speleological researches has demonstrated that a large number of animals lives in the Caves of Castellana and some of them belong to new endemic species.<br /> The entrance of the Grave, that is to say the deep chasm, had always struck terror into the people going along the nearby country street, above all at twilight.<br /> <br /> [A Wyld Caern in the middle of the sightseeing industry? Better ask some Black Fury or the local Mokol\u00e9]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T18:40:55-07:00","id":197301,"title":"","content":"I used to live near L.A. And now I live in San Francisco and while the books on those places are now pretty dated, I don't think they did the real cities any justice in how many different ways they could be used in ALL systems. I think lots of places and regions could make awesome setting for lots of games and totally deserved their own supplement book. Maybe Fans could start compiling info for places and how they could be used in different WoD settings through an online website like the Garou Glyph project or the Rage Across Google maps Project.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T12:38:35-07:00","id":198122,"title":"","content":"<b>@Darling_Rose:</b> Great idea there. A online Rage Across, By Night, Haunts, A World of Darkness project would be really cool to cover all parts of the globe. <a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Maybe the Cyber Record could have a section for that?</a><br /> <br /> I'm also with you on updating the info, Rose.<br /> I had actually long term plans for a huge Rage Across California fan project on the sidelines (<i>Since I have other stuff that I do</i>) where I wanted to retcon the bane, Cataclysm from Caerns: Places of Power (<i>Because my inner Geologist and <a href=\"http://www.topangaonline.com/nativam/turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\">Folklore/Myth</a> geek rages at it</i>). <a href=\"http://earthquake.usgs.gov/learn/topics/megaqk_facts_fantasy.php\" target=\"_blank\">The idea/myth of California entirely sinking into the ocean needs to <b>die</b>.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1137,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","user":"Laughing Hyena","date":"Opps), it's Cataclysm... 07-15-2014, 07:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T12:58:01-07:00","id":198135,"title":"","content":"The treatment of my hometown (San Diego) has always made me chuckle. There's a lot of drama (the Anarch Baron of the city sells out to the Camarilla for power and to protect her domain from Sabbat raids and the Kuei-Jin!) for our sleepy tourist city, and the characterization of the Gaslamp as a violent, seedy place (in V20 Companion) made me laugh out loud; it's the punchline for many jokes in my friend group. (For reference; the Gaslamp is the portion of Downtown leading straight to the Convention Center of Comic-Con fame; it's a bunch of knick-knack shops, overpriced trendy restaurants, and hotels; hardly the place for Cainite brawls).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-16T20:11:22-07:00","id":199574,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Laughing Hyena</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/197138-the-dark-corners-of-the-earth-location-location-location?p=198122#post198122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>@Darling_Rose:</b> Great idea there. A online Rage Across, By Night, Haunts, A World of Darkness project would be really cool to cover all parts of the globe.</div> </div> </div> </div>*Squees* Coming from you Laughing Hyena, that's the best compliment. I've admired your work with the Rage cards for a long time.<br /> <br /> The Cyber Record seems to be mainly Garou-centric, but I'm sure a new website and joint efforts between those who can put in the time would be able to start up a Cities project, much like Yakacen-Sing's Mnesis project with a open Google doc with fan developed PDFs on the different locations. I wish I had more time to devote to projects like these, maybe even managing the website, but I have very weak skills in site managing and my work schedule doesn't allow me the time I'd like to really delve into the mechanics of fleshing out a City setting. I have a lot of historical notes and whatnot for my city and there are quite a few METS members here in San Fran I'd be glad to get info from if someone else can do the formatting into something usable for other people.<br /> <br /> Maybe someone can make an editable template?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-17T11:25:59-07:00","id":200276,"title":"","content":"Somewhere in the mysterious lands of Missouri.<br /> <br /> Pythian Castle - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pythian_Home_of_Missouri\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pythian_Home_of_Missouri</a><br /> Wraith: The children that inhabit the castle are in a constant state of torture. Molestation, torture, and almost completely melted down for soulsteel or oboli. None of the children gone to Oblivion or becoming Spectres since some of the adult Wraiths know how to keep them pleased just enough to keep Oblivion at bay.<br /> <br /> Wilson's Creek - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilson%27s_Creek_National_Battlefield\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wilson%...al_Battlefield</a><br /> Wraith: This battle keeps repeating itself every three days. Wraiths that became sentient from the battle or came to visit could attempt to take the opportunity to scavenge the battlefield for Relics or Corpus for smelting. Some abandon taking the Relics since when the battle begins anew the Relics return to it's owner. Corpus on the other hand mysteriously respawns, Wraiths can clean out the battlefield and when the battle restarts all the soldiers reappear, with their full Corpus and their Relics at hand.<br /> <br /> Marvel Cavern - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marvel_Cave\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marvel_Cave</a><br /> Werewolf: There are rumors that this cave might have a hidden Camazotz Colony. While in reality the amusement park looks about your average amusement park, in the Umbra it's a different story. There is no taint, bare minimum at worst, and the cave's Totem Many Bat (looks like a huge bat made of several colonies of bats) haven't fallen to the Wyrm. The park makes a perfect disguise since Branson is a huge place of power for the Weaver and her webs hides the truth beneath Gaia's bossom.<br /> <br /> Pomme de Terre - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pomme_de_Terre_Lake\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pomme_de_Terre_Lake</a><br /> Werewolf: Renamed The Caern of Strange Waters. The local Garou not only keeps the waters physically and spiritually clean, back in 2009 the Conservation Department discovered jellyfish in it's waters (<a href=\"http://jeffcity.media.clients.ellingtoncms.com/img/photos/2013/10/22/LT_OUT_freshwaterjellyfishop1_sub_t670.JPG?b3f6a5d7692ccc373d56e40cf708e3fa67d9af9d\" target=\"_blank\">http://jeffcity.media.clients.elling...08e3fa67d9af9d</a>). This dedication has been reflected in the Umbra as for jellyfish spirits have appeared. Two packs have taken Jellyfish as their Totems. Pomme de Terre isn't the only lake, in 2013 Lake of the Ozarks has gained it's own jellyfish. Gaia is shining through, some Garou say that the signs of the Wyrm and the Weaver are weakening. Perhaps in time the Garou would call the Ozarks the Land of Strange Waters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T12:03:22-07:00","id":201328,"title":"","content":"ill writte somethings about chile whenever i got the chance, any particular places yer curious about around here? Easter Island? the North , the south? the center and the ghosts of the 73?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T14:54:48-07:00","id":201490,"title":"","content":"Ghosts of the 73? That sounds like a Wraith hook if I ever heard one. Care to tell us about that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T17:40:20-07:00","id":201634,"title":"","content":"I just wanted to pop in and say that I love everything going on in here. At present, I don't have time to pledge to the cause in a more hands on capacity, but I'll help promote and host whatever people need to support this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T18:39:18-07:00","id":201671,"title":"","content":"I'm willing to set up a website or an email account to handle submissions if someone wants to help with format and writing content. I'm totally willing to share the log-ins and password with up to 2 other people.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T21:42:19-07:00","id":201773,"title":"","content":"The Ghost of the 73.<br /> This is a story of Sorrow, and hatred, rage and wrath. I wont go into much details since involves heavy politics from before i was born. Ill try to be as Subjective as possible since its a open wound still in my country.<br /> Im chilean, keep that in mind and that english isnt my first language.<br /> <br /> During the end of the 60's and the begining of the 70's, The president was Salvador Allende, a socialist president choosen by the People. Things on his goverment werent ok. There was a lot of conflicts between the left goverment and unions and syndicates, a lot of food strikes and such.<br /> <br /> Things got worst.<br /> <br /> September 11th of 1973. The military took over by a Cue De Gra,leaded by General Augusto Pinochet, La Moneda (our Presidential house. sort of like a White house but the president didnt lived there) was bombarded while the military was deployed onto the streets, killing anyone who supported Allende.<br /> <br /> President Allende made a final radio statement wishing for a better world, on his own words and i Quote from Wikipedia.<br /> &quot;Workers of my country, I have faith in Chile and its destiny. Other men will overcome this dark and bitter moment when treason seeks to prevail. Keep in mind that, much sooner than later, the great avenues will again be opened through which will pass free men to construct a better society. Long live Chile! Long live the people! Long live the workers!&quot;<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_of_Salvador_Allende\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Lentes_Salvador_Allende.jpg/1280px-Lentes_Salvador_Allende.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_of_Salvador_Allende\" target=\"_blank\"> Death of Salvador Allende - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_of_Salvador_Allende\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_of_Salvador_Allende </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> After that, a gunshot ecchoed on every single radio connected to the presidental broadcast. He commited suicide with an AK-47 given by Fidel Castro.<br /> <br /> General Pinochet took over the goverment, he improved things, he forced nightwatches and a lot of people dissapeared during his goverment. Theres hundreds of witness accounts of Camps in which the suspected suporters were tortured and killed, their bodies missing. some of the survivors changed forever.<br /> This lasted from 1973 to 1990.<br /> <br /> Movies were censored, books, media was over controlled, people got executed on the streets during the first days and the death camps were something everyone knew about but not everyone wanted to aknowledge or accept (even if Pinochet tried to hide this), The left keep fighting the right with everything they had. the military keep pushing them at bay.<br /> During this time, around 3.000 individuals were Captured and vanished, other 2.000 were imprissioned and tortured through the country.<br /> <br /> Places like The National Stadium were used as detention camps, musicians such as Victor Jara.<br /> Some others exiled themselves out of the country.<br /> <br /> Due to that, Some claim that theres a lot of strong energy and presence on places where people died during this times, places like The National Stadium, Augusto Pinochet's house (a building made of black stones which now is a college), La Moneda, and some of the mountains sorrounding the city, as well the Military Academy of Santiago among others.<br /> <br /> Places like Patio 29 (Courtyard 29) were discovered during the following years, a sort of Unmarked graveyard where where political prisoners, especially those who <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disappeared#Chile\" target=\"_blank\">&quot;disappeared&quot;</a> during the <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1973_Chilean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\" target=\"_blank\">1973 Chilean coup d'\u00e9tat</a>, were <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anonymous_burial\" target=\"_blank\">buried anonymously</a>. The mass grave, the largest of <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augusto_Pinochet\" target=\"_blank\">Augusto Pinochet</a>'s <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_government_of_Chile_%281973%E2%80%9390%29\" target=\"_blank\">military government</a>, was used for unannounced and <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Unmarked_grave\" target=\"_blank\">unmarked</a> burials in the 1970s until an anonymous tip alerted the public to its usage.<br /> <br /> some aprehentions continued during the 80's, protests were incredibly violent. and groups like the <b>Direcci\u00f3n de Inteligencia Nacional</b> (National Intelligence Directorate.) keept and incredibly tight grip by arresting anyone who they suspected of being leftists or to opose to Pinochet, from assassinations to make them dissapear with no trace. its well known that these secret police were instructed on techniques of assassination and torture.<br /> <br /> This Era has ended, Augusto Pinochet lost on 1988 to the popular vote Yes (for him to stay in goverment) and No (for him to leave), The No won., the Democracy came back on 1990.<br /> Every year, the Chilean September 11th is remembered, some people light candles for their missing relatives. others go to the streets to fight cops and do senseless destruction.<br /> <br /> Thing is, For the events that took place in my country almost 41 years ago, we still live under the shadow of what happend, Buildings are haunted by those who were tortured and died.<br /> <br /> Chile is a country of Mystisicm, of Mapuche Magic and Folklore mixed with political events. Its accepted that our country is very haunted, its accepted that places like Patio 29, or The National Stadium hold the souls of those who died and were tortured.<br /> <br /> The haunting continues, and theres nothing to do. Only to try to forget the past, and avoid repeating it yet again. and teach the young generations about what happend and to avoid causing havok due the remembering of the September 11th (Many of the guys who do sensless destruction during that date, do it because they feel like it, no political inclination or anything like it.)<br /> <br /> <br /> en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salvador_Allende<br /> en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Augusto_Pinochet<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1973_Chilean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b5/Golpe_de_Estado_1973.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=index&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1973_Chilean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\" target=\"_blank\"> 1973 Chilean coup d'&eacute;tat - Wikipedia </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1973_Chilean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\" target=\"_blank\"> http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1973_Chilean_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caso_Degollados\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caso_Degollados</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chile_under_Pinochet\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chile_under_Pinochet</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Direcci%C3%B3n_de_Inteligencia_Nacional\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Direcci...encia_Nacional</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valech_Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valech_Report</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Villa_Grimaldi\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Villa_Grimaldi</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colonia_Dignidad\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colonia_Dignidad</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esmeralda_%28BE-43%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Esmeralda_%28BE-43%29</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patio_29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patio_29</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_rights_in_Chile\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Human_rights_in_Chile</a><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuel_Contreras\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manuel_Contreras</a><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":1754,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","user":"Crowley","date":". 07-19-2014, 12:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T21:45:17-07:00","id":201775,"title":"","content":"I wish I have the time. Working 40 hour weeks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T21:59:14-07:00","id":201780,"title":"","content":"Same here Paladin. And I work through weekends too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T22:03:58-07:00","id":201782,"title":"","content":"Crowley: That's very moving and would be very good material for a Wraith setting, that is, if it's not too sensitive or personal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T22:25:23-07:00","id":201805,"title":"","content":"Other stories from my country.<br /> <br /> In the Mouth of Darkness.<br /> <br /> During the 1880 - 1907, miners were paid with tokens, this tokens they could trade it for food, so they would never get paid. on a lot of mines many of the miners died and started to haunt this mines and towns sorrounding the mines (like chuquicamata). Social movement started and there was a strike, miners from all of the north (the nort of my country is the most driest desert of the world) went to La Escuela Santa Maria de Iquique (Saint Mary School of Iquique) to organize a strike. the military were deployed and hundreds of miners died when soldiers start shooting at them<br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Mar%C3%ADa_School_massacre\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_M...chool_massacre</a><br /> <br /> -----------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> The Bride of Kennedy.<br /> One of the highways that go through the city of santiago is called The John F Kennedy Highway (or Kennedy), in which during times of the Day and/or night you can see a woman asking for a being picked up, usually to married couples. When she goes up she asks you to take her to the nearby market. If you drive too fast, you can hear her saying very softly &quot;be careful, drive slower please.&quot; in a very soft and kind manner. If you turn around to see her, you wont find her since she vanishes. her name is Maria Infante, she died on 1978 after heading home from her boyfriend's house.<br /> <br /> ------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> Fire in Tower Saint Mary.<br /> <br /> During the 80,s chile had a very tall tower called Torre Santa Maria, in santiago. There were some works on the tenth floor of the building and one of the workers left a cigar lighted on an rug (which was recently glued and was a fire hazard), the tower caught fire from its 10th floor and people were stranded. groups of fireman were to fight the flames, 3 members of the fire department died that day, and 2 or 3 civilians died while jumping of the building. some others died because of the fire and/or due the CO2. the fire was stopped, but ever since. if you go to that building sometimes you can see the shadow of the jumper running against the windows, and on the elevators you can see fireman standing next to you while waiting to head to the tenth floor.<br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> Friendship Island.<br /> <br /> On the south of chile theres a lot of forests, cold and lakes. and a incredibly large ammount of islands. Particulary one. Frienship Island<br /> A man with cancer was reached by &quot;A Force&quot; claiming to come from Frienship island. The man headed to the island and he meet blond people, incredibly tall and knowing &quot;A Lot.&quot; whom they cured his cancer and told him they came &quot;From a better place.&quot; apparently the island doesnt appear on any map, and people of Island Frienship had &quot;Strange technology&quot; which healed him up.<br /> During 1985 a UFo appeared on santiago while on the radios (from the people who keept contact with friendship) claimed they could control the UFO, giving it orders by the radio and the UFO moved following the radio orders. On 1995 the comunications with Friendship were suddenly stopped.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T22:38:11-07:00","id":201815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/197138-the-dark-corners-of-the-earth-location-location-location?p=201782#post201782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Crowley: That's very moving and would be very good material for a Wraith setting, that is, if it's not too sensitive or personal.</div> </div> </div> </div>well, its complicated. i dont mind if you guys use it for Wraith, hell. i love if Rich took it and used it for the new Wraith (the ghosts of the 73). but in a way, its personal to every chilean, theres MILLIONS of stories of that era, and some stories havent finished. people like Manuel Conteras still live, even if he denies all the torture and murder and claim it was a &quot;Comunist Conspiracy to make Pinochet look bad.&quot; its a touchy subject for chile, as long is handled with respect and maturity. as long people understands what happend. There were bad desitions on both sides, i cant say anything about it because i dont want to get in a political debate. but i dont accept the murder and torture of human beings. i think what im trying to say is, (and not trying to justify anyones actions) people will follow orders, people will do what they belive its right. even if its horrible.<br /> <br /> i dont want people to glorify the left or the right, to say that the People were the Good Ones and that the Military were Evil, because evil lies within all of us. The left tried to kill pinochet many times, they even killed members of their goverment, i wont justify any of the actions. but i want to tell people what happend.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-18T22:48:55-07:00","id":201823,"title":"","content":"Reconciling history with an imaginary and dark game setting is tricky and has to walk a careful line. I wouldn't touch a New York Wraith setting with a 10 ft pole if I was expected to somehow include the events of our own November 11.<br /> <br /> Even though I've willing to write about Los Angeles or San Francisco, there's some very dark and sensitive topics that need to be written about carefully and with proper respect to history and the victims without making it seem trivial because it's a part of an imaginary game. I also don't want other people to trivialize certain serious issues or events when they look for material to run in the setting. People in other areas of California always joke about how every summer the southern end of the state is on fire, and I don't find it funny because I was there during one particularly bad season and I remember growing up how there were hardly any fires in the summer. Now it's a stereotype. It's going to be hard getting the balance of information with imagination and history just right.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T09:07:47-07:00","id":202195,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/197138-the-dark-corners-of-the-earth-location-location-location?p=201780#post201780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Same here Paladin. And I work through weekends too.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't mind as much if my job wasn't so boring.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T13:23:12-07:00","id":202340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/197138-the-dark-corners-of-the-earth-location-location-location?p=201823#post201823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even though I've willing to write about Los Angeles or San Francisco, there's some very dark and sensitive topics that need to be written about carefully and with proper respect to history and the victims without making it seem trivial because it's a part of an imaginary game. I also don't want other people to trivialize certain serious issues or events when they look for material to run in the setting. People in other areas of California always joke about how every summer the southern end of the state is on fire, and I don't find it funny because I was there during one particularly bad season and I remember growing up how there were hardly any fires in the summer. Now it's a stereotype. It's going to be hard getting the balance of information with imagination and history just right.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can understand, there was one big fire that got pretty close where I was a few years back (<i>This was the one in Malibu</i>). The sky was a deep red/orange for several days, you had to keep inside and close the windows to not breathe any of it. Thankfully, it was taken care of in time.<br /> The problem is that the area is covered by Chaparral plants. These are plants that have evolved to release their seeds when they are set on fire. Many of these plants even have their own oil that they put out.<br /> <br /> One would have to be very careful with writing about the Los Angeles Riots, Alaska Airlines Flight 261, or even about <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_La_Conchita_landslide\" target=\"_blank\">Mud slides</a>.<br /> <br /> I do take it that the forces of the Wyld are certainly powerful in California and it would be something Garou would have to contend with besides just the Weaver and the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> <u>Now for another place:</u><br /> <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Channel_Islands_of_California\" target=\"_blank\"><b>The Channel Islands</b></a><br /> The Channel Islands consist of <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anacapa_Island\" target=\"_blank\">Anacapa</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Miguel_Island\" target=\"_blank\">San Miguel</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Cruz_Island\" target=\"_blank\">Santa Cruz</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Rosa_Island,_California\" target=\"_blank\">Santa Rosa</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Clemente_Island\" target=\"_blank\">San Clemente</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/San_Nicolas_Island\" target=\"_blank\">San Nicolas</a>, <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Catalina_Island,_California\" target=\"_blank\">Catalina</a>, and <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Santa_Barbara_Island\" target=\"_blank\">Santa Barbara Island</a>. Only Catalina is inhabited by humans and even has a city. The rest are visited by U.S. National Park Service men and women with tourists who take trips by boats and hike the islands. However, there are certain times of the year that the Channel Islands (<i>excluding Catalina</i>) are closed to any visitors. It is that time that Garou who belong to the hidden Caerns on the islands (<i>Mostly Uktena</i>) travel by moonbridge to get there. There they can hold moots that will not be interrupted. However, there are rumors of a nearby Rokea grotto in the area.<br /> The kinfolk that belong to the Conservancy projects have done much to bring the Island Fox back, and thus the Channel Islands Fox has become a totem spirit for the area.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-19T22:33:30-07:00","id":202663,"title":"","content":"LH: I was growing up in So cal and before we moved out of the area for other reasons, I remember a week of nights I could stand on my roof and watch the nearby mountain range on fire. We were so worried it would reach Mt Wilson because as a family we used to visit the Griffith Observatory during the summers. We didn't go that year. I haven't been back since. I forget the year it was, but it was before the Observatory was renovated and definitely before the year 2000. I remember taking it for granted that those hills and mountains would always look green. Even years afterward they still looked black and brown and drab. I haven't lived in that area for 10 years now and it's probably recovered, but those nights watching the mountains on fire and the fear and despair I felt will be something I'll never forget.<br /> <br /> Where I live now in SF, people annually remember the great fire of 1906. And yet in what seems to be San Franciscan fashion, it's more of a celebratory memorial than a mournful one. There's a society of conservationalists who break out the garb of the era, climb in thier Model Ts and there's a procession/parade that moves along one end of San Fransisco to the other following the fire break that saved half the city from burning to the ground. There's even a &quot;famous&quot; <a href=\"http://www.atlasobscura.com/places/the-golden-fire-hydrant\" target=\"_blank\">fire hydrant</a> that receives a yearly coat of gold paint commemorating the only source of water to a fire threatened Mission district saving homes and lives of that neighborhood. San Fransisco holds its Fire Fighters in the highest regard to this day. What I hope to capture when I eventually write about SF as a setting for all World of Darkness Denizens is the feelings of small points like these. How that fire Hydrant might be important now as a Relic or a meeting spot for the Bone Gnawers of Dolores Park. Everywhere, in every city, there are these treasures of history that could be embellished to legendary status within our games. I don't think they should belong to any one system.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-20T08:54:35-07:00","id":202995,"title":"","content":"More from the mysterious lands of Missouri. You think I'm joking, most people in Europe think Missouri doesn't exist or is Detroit.<br /> <br /> Cape Girardeau - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cape_Girardeau,_Missouri\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cape_Girardeau,_Missouri</a> <a href=\"http://www.ufocasebook.com/missouricrash.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.ufocasebook.com/missouricrash.html</a><br /> Any: In 1941 a unique disaster occurred. A crash happened outside of the city limits. When paramedics arrived, it was too late so they called the resident pastor to deliver last rights to the pilot and two passengers. The occupants are extraterrestrial, and the crash predated Roswell. The military was quick to cover this event up. But anyone who is interested to excavate what the military missed, feel free if you dare.<br /> <br /> Zombie Road - <a href=\"http://www.prairieghosts.com/zombie_road.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.prairieghosts.com/zombie_road.html</a><br /> Wraith: Another site haunted by child Wraiths. The Wraiths appear to be lost, unsure why they can not go very far from the road. The Fog is thin at this site. Any camera can detect the lost Wraiths. The town near by in the Skinlands trick investigators to either keep them away, or to make their investigations invalid.<br /> <br /> Highway 13 - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highway_13_%28Missouri%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Highway_13_%28Missouri%29</a><br /> Wraith: While it seems pretty normal in the Skinlands, it is a well known death highway between Humansville and Bolivar. In the Shadowlands it is the a major contributor to Missouri's Wraith population and a great location for Relic cars, trucks, diesels, and motorcycles. When a death is very traumatic, it combines Wraith with Relic into a new Spectre. Older Wraiths have no name for these vehicular Spectres, younger Wraiths have several names depending on the vehicle used for the fusion. Car Spectres are Dragulas (more from the Rob Zombie song), Truck Spectres are Hellrigs (monster trucks were taken in the Skinlands), Diesel Spectres are Duelists (ala the movie), and Motorcycle Spectres are Ghost Riders (via the comics and movies).<br /> <br /> Kansas City - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaman_%28cryptid%29\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beaman_%28cryptid%29</a><br /> Werewolf: There's a strange creature that stalks near Kansas City Missouri. It's describe as a 12 foot tall gorilla. The last known siting was in 1904, but rumors are starting to circulate that the gorilla returned but might be an agent of the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> Joplin - <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flying_Rod\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flying_Rod</a><br /> Mage: Strange insects have been sited near the city of Joplin. While a tv investigation proved that it was fault of the equipment for one of the sightings, more of these strange insects are being sighted. These insects seem to be a part of Paradox. From either natural progression or from man's involvement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}